    <labels>
        <fullName>CORE_IPS_GEC_Query_One</fullName>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>IPS GEC Question One</shortDescription>
        <value>Do any of your questions relate to the use of Intel products in a military, defense, intelligence, nuclear/biochemical or space item?</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>CORE_IPS_GEC_Query_One_Addl_Info</fullName>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>IPS GEC Question One Additional Info</shortDescription>
        <value>* Due to US and other countries’ export regulations, any questions, technical support, services, feedback, guidance, optimization, training, assistance, or other work performed by Intel that are directed toward the incorporation and/or implementation of Intel’s product in a military, defense intelligence, nuclear/biochemical or space item may result in a defense service or the transfer of technical data and require authorization from the US or other applicable governments.</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>CORE_IPS_GEC_Query_Two</fullName>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>IPS GEC Question Two</shortDescription>
        <value>Will you be providing any technical data that is related to a defense article or any military, defense, intelligence, nuclear/biochemical or space end use?</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>CORE_IPS_GEC_Query_Two_Addl_Info</fullName>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>IPS GEC Question Two Additional Info</shortDescription>
        <value>* Information posted in this case may be open and accessible to all Intel employees without restriction as to their location or citizenship. Do not upload any technical data or documents that are subject to export restrictions without first obtaining Intel’s approval to accept such data. All defense, military intelligence, nuclear/biochemical or space related technical data, including ITAR-controlled information shall be specifically marked as such and should only be provided using secure communication methods approved in writing by Intel.  Please contact your Intel account owner for more details.  IPS is not approved for all export controlled data</value>
    </labels>
