    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_AAQC_WELCOME_MESSAGE_EXTENSION</fullName>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core AAQC WELCOME MESSAGE EXTENSION</shortDescription>
        <value>&quot;The Ask Commissions capability is to allow Intel sales employees to ask questions regarding commissions and obtain answers.  All Ask Commissions information is stored on Salesforce servers located in the United States for a minimum of 24 months.  Access to Ask Commissions information is strictly controlled and limited to the Commissions Office team. 

For your protection, please do not enter any personal information such as passwords, PINs, Bank details, address, User IDs, security words or any part of your social security/Identification number. If this information is required, a Commissions Office team member will securely collect the sensitive personal information from you later.

Click here to read about Intel’s Global Employee and Contingent Worker Privacy Notice&quot;</value>
    </labels>
