    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_Banner</fullName>
        <categories>Core</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_Banner</shortDescription>
        <value>&lt;p&gt; 
&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;green&quot;&gt;Attention:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; 
Per the &lt;a href=&quot;https://soco.intel.com/docs/DOC-2635651&quot;&gt;WW28 SMG Newsletter&lt;/a&gt;, 
export compliance improvements to Sales CRM are here! The MAG account field is still viewable on the account screen, but use of Intel products and solutions for military, intelligence, nuclear/biochemical, defense, and space (MINDS) use is now managed at the opportunity level. The MAG account value can be adjusted, if necessary, by contacting &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:export.customer@intel.com&quot;&gt;export.customer@intel.com&lt;/a&gt;. Please join &lt;a href=&quot;https://targetmailer.intel.com/tmservice/getmeetinginfo.aspx?meetinginfoid=165229&quot;&gt;WW34.2&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://targetmailer.intel.com/tmservice/getmeetinginfo.aspx?meetinginfoid=165228&quot;&gt;WW34.4&lt;/a&gt; Office Hours to &lt;a href=&quot;https://salescrm.intel.com/ww3219/&quot;&gt;learn more&lt;/a&gt;. 
&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;br&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;It&apos;s vacation and sabbatical season! Follow &lt;a href=&quot;https://soco.intel.com/message/5313709&quot;&gt;these BKMs&lt;/a&gt; before you leave.</value>
    </labels>
