    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MAG_Intro</fullName>
        <categories>Core_MAGQuestionnaireController</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MAG_Intro</shortDescription>
        <value>Please answer the questions below immediately to initiate the GEC review and enable this opportunity to move forward in the cycle. It takes several days to complete the review and in some cases the GEC team will come back with requests for additional information. The opportunity may not be submitted for approval until the review is complete and the GEC Team is able to determine whether the hold may be removed, so please answer any follow up questions quickly.</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MAG_Number_of_Questions</fullName>
        <categories>Core_MAGQuestionnaireController</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MAG_Number_of_Questions</shortDescription>
        <value>7</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MAG_Outtro</fullName>
        <categories>Core_MAGQuestionnaireController</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MAG_Outtro</shortDescription>
        <value>Please refer to ‘Doing Business with Military, Aerospace &amp; Government (MAG) Customers – Guidelines’ document for guidance on how to engage with your customer(s) in an ITAR Compliant manner while the GEC review is in progress: &lt;a href=&quot;https://sp2010.amr.ith.intel.com/sites/gec/_layouts/DocIdRedir.aspx?ID=INTEL-5-104&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://sp2010.amr.ith.intel.com/sites/gec/_layouts/DocIdRedir.aspx?ID=INTEL-5-104&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;p/&gt;
Please refer to ‘Export of Defense Services’ for more details: 
&lt;a href=&quot;https://sp2010.amr.ith.intel.com/sites/gec/SitePages/Defense%20Services.aspx&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://sp2010.amr.ith.intel.com/sites/gec/SitePages/Defense%20Services.aspx&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;p/&gt;
You may be contacted by a representative from the Global Export Compliance team for more details.</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MAG_Q1</fullName>
        <categories>Core_MAGQuestionnaireController</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MAG_Q1</shortDescription>
        <value>1. Please select all applicable end uses that the Intel item will be incorporated into, or used in.  Or select 13 if none of the above apply.
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Military end-item or application&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defense article&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unmanned (or optionally manned) aerial vehicle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weapon System&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intelligence system or application&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rocket&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Space-related item&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Satellite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nuclear-related item&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chemical / Biological Weapons or Precursors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US Government Classified item or application&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Government Classified item or application in non-US country&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;None of the above (the end-use is civilian / non-military)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;</value>
    </labels>
