    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MAG_Q2</fullName>
        <categories>Core_MAGQuestionnaireController</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MAG_Q2</shortDescription>
        <value>2. Does this project involve ONLY Intel commercial-off-the-shelf (COTS) products with existing SKUs, no separate BINs, and which will not be changed/developed, modified, or enhanced in any way?
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;If No, describe/explain.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MAG_Q2_Textbox</fullName>
        <categories>Core_MAGQuestionnaireController</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MAG_Q2_Textbox</shortDescription>
        <value>Please answer YES or NO.  If No, describe/explain.</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MAG_Q3</fullName>
        <categories>Core_MAGQuestionnaireController</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MAG_Q3</shortDescription>
        <value>3. Will Intel provide any technical support (including both hardware and software support) (e.g. design-in, co-development solutions, design reviews, schematic reviews, layout reviews, troubleshooting, fixing bugs, software optimization, hardware integration, analysis testing, etc.)?
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;If Yes, describe planned/anticipated technical support.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MAG_Q3_Textbox</fullName>
        <categories>Core_MAGQuestionnaireController</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MAG_Q3_Textbox</shortDescription>
        <value>Please answer YES or NO.  If Yes, describe planned/anticipated technical support.</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MAG_Q4</fullName>
        <categories>Core_MAGQuestionnaireController</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MAG_Q4</shortDescription>
        <value>4. Will Intel provide any interactive or unique training to this customer?
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;If Yes, describe planned/anticipated training.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MAG_Q4_Textbox</fullName>
        <categories>Core_MAGQuestionnaireController</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MAG_Q4_Textbox</shortDescription>
        <value>Please answer YES or NO.  If Yes, describe planned/anticipated training.</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MAG_Q5</fullName>
        <categories>Core_MAGQuestionnaireController</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MAG_Q5</shortDescription>
        <value>5. Will Intel create or transfer any technical data other than: published information, basic marketing material; Intel roadmap; product samples; unmodified pre-existing electronic design kits; marketing information about product capabilities, features, and how to use them; or Intel Standard Commercial Data Sheets and User&apos;s Manual for Intel products?
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;If Yes, describe what technical data will be created and/or provided.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MAG_Q5_Textbox</fullName>
        <categories>Core_MAGQuestionnaireController</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MAG_Q5_Textbox</shortDescription>
        <value>Please answer YES or NO.  If Yes, describe what technical data will be created and/or provided.</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MAG_Q6</fullName>
        <categories>Core_MAGQuestionnaireController</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MAG_Q6</shortDescription>
        <value>6. Will this customer/end-user transfer any technical data to Intel (e.g. information, guidelines, designs, schematics, specifications, or other information)?
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;If Yes, describe what technical data will be received.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MAG_Q6_Textbox</fullName>
        <categories>Core_MAGQuestionnaireController</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MAG_Q6_Textbox</shortDescription>
        <value>Please answer YES or NO.  If Yes, describe what technical data will be received.</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MAG_Q7</fullName>
        <categories>Core_MAGQuestionnaireController</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MAG_Q7</shortDescription>
        <value>7. Is the US Government a customer or end user, or do you anticipate any Federal Acquisition Regulation (FAR) or DFARS clauses?
&lt;ul&gt; 
&lt;li&gt;This question is not related to ITAR or export classification.  It has no impact on your deal moving forward.  Instead it is to provide help for negotiating and complying with terms specific for the US Government.  Many opportunities directly with the US Government or with other companies who work with the US Government have requirements from the Federal Acquisition Regulation (FAR) or Defense FAR Supplement (DFARS) that, if in the contract, put specific requirements on Intel.  If you believe any of these FAR/DFARS clauses will be in your opportunity, Intel Federal may contact you as we would like to help you ensure that Intel Corporate can comply with those requirements and potentially help you to negotiate more favorable terms for Intel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MAG_Q7_Textbox</fullName>
        <categories>Core_MAGQuestionnaireController</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MAG_Q7_Textbox</shortDescription>
        <value>Please answer Yes, No, Unsure, or Not a US Opportunity</value>
    </labels>
